UID:jt26-d4-1@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T175817Z
DTSTART:20261212T230000Z
DTEND:20261212T233000Z
SUMMARY:JR to Tokyo Station
DESCRIPTION:Chūō Line rapid\, 15 min.\n≈ ¥210–230\nDay 4: Monkeys i
 n the hot spring\, then your own
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Leave in 20 min: JR to Tokyo Station
TRIGGER:-PT30M
