SUMMARY:Zenkō-ji
LOCATION:Zenkō-ji
DESCRIPTION:10 min walk from Gondō. A 1\,400-year-old temple with a pitch
 -dark tunnel under the altar: find the "key to paradise" by touch. Soba o
 r oyaki on the approach street.\ninner hall ≈ ¥600 · lunch ≈ ¥1\,5
 00\nDay 5: Temple\, then all the way north
END:VEVENT
