UID:jt26-d5-5@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T175817Z
DTSTART:20261214T083000Z
DTEND:20261214T113000Z
SUMMARY:Fly to Sapporo
DESCRIPTION:Pick a departure between 17:30 and 18:30. Power banks stay wit
 h you at your seat\, not in the overhead bin.\n≈ ¥9\,000–16\,000\nDa
 y 5: Temple\, then all the way north
