SUMMARY:Check in at La'gent Stay
LOCATION:La'gent Stay Sapporo Odori
DESCRIPTION:JR Rapid Airport from New Chitose\, 37 min. Outside it's aroun
 d −3 °C and probably snowing.\ntrain ≈ ¥1\,200\nDay 5: Temple\, the
 n all the way north
