BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d5-7@japan26-trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T175817Z
DTSTART:20261214T121500Z
DTEND:20261214T140000Z
SUMMARY:Jingisukan at Daruma
LOCATION:Daruma\, Susukino
DESCRIPTION:Grilled lamb on a dome-shaped skillet\, Sapporo's signature. S
 everal branches in Susukino\, open late\, counter seats\, the queue moves
  fast. Sapporo Classic on tap.\n≈ ¥3\,500–5\,000\nDay 5: Temple\, th
 en all the way north
END:VEVENT
